Tokens quick example (JS):
const theme = {
  buttonPrimaryBg: tokens['brand-600'],
  tableBorder: tokens['neutral-200']
};

Do: use the tokens object exported by the runtime theme rather than raw CSS variables.

Button migration example (React):
// Before
<button className="btn btn-primary">Save</button>

// After
import {Button} from '@redwood-ui/button'
<Button variant="primary">Save</Button>

